OL,3,GNEWSADog charity celebrates century on
OL,4,Athe road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA service which helps saves the lives
OL,7,Fof more than1,000 stray or abandoned
OL,8,Fdogs a year, is celebrating a century
OL,9,Fof being on the road.
OL,11,FThe National Canine Defence League, now
OL,12,Fthe Dogs Trust, was founded in1891 to
OL,13,Fcampaign against cruelty, and purchased
OL,14,Fits first ambulance in 1926.
OL,16,FOperating from a base in Penrith,
OL,17,FCumbria, the charity's vehicles
OL,18,Ftransport unwanted animals to rehoming
OL,19,Fcentres across the UK, or into local
OL,20,Ffoster care.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
