OL,3,GNEWSADog charity celebrates century on
OL,4,Athe road
OL,5,
OL,6,FEach of its five ambulances is designed
OL,7,Fwith the dogs' comfort in mind, and
OL,8,Fdriver Aimee Turner said: "We give them
OL,9,Ftime to settle and play classical music
OL,10,Fto help them relax."
